
---

# 5. `.gitignore`

This prevents accidental secrets and unnecessary files from entering GitHub.

```gitignore
# Arduino / PlatformIO
.pio/
.vscode/
*.elf
*.bin
*.hex
*.eep

# Arduino temporary files
*.bak
*.tmp

# Operating system
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# IDE files
.idea/
*.iml

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
env/

# Environment / secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# API keys / credentials
secrets.h
credentials.h
config_private.h

# Logs
*.log

# Temporary files
*.tmp
*.temp

# Node
node_modules/

# Build output
dist/
build/